('kettle-cave', 'Cave, Kettle Hill (north face)', 'cave', 12.951181, 77.501304, 1384, 'Unmarked cave at the southern edge of the map, a footpath past the last stop. Matches the geotag on two childhood photos (SOC-006, SOC-009).'),
